    <p>Local officials and public working GIS point to technical work near the 5100 West corridor, but UDOT's formal alignment maps remain the controlling source once published.{% cite "whc-warnke-minutes" %}{% cite "arcgis-sr177-project-layers-may2026" %}</p>
  </div>
